    <string name="onboarding_player_title">Control what plays on Discord</string>
    <string name="onboarding_player_description">Your phone is a remote for Qumi. See the current track and its progress, skip or stop it, turn on repeat, or add it to favorites.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_queue_title">Full control of the queue</string>
    <string name="onboarding_queue_description">Press and drag a track to change its position. Remove individual entries, clear the entire queue, or quickly search for and add another track.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_add_title">Add music your way</string>
    <string name="onboarding_add_description">Search for a track by name, paste a direct link, or use your device’s Share feature, for example in YouTube. Qumi picks up the link and opens a dedicated screen to add the shared track.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_favorites_title">Favorites always at hand</string>
    <string name="onboarding_favorites_description">Save your favorite tracks and add them to the queue later with one tap. You can also add the entire list at once and optionally shuffle the order.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_radio_title">Radio when the queue ends</string>
    <string name="onboarding_radio_description">Turn on Radio and Qumi will automatically pick a track from history when the regular queue runs out. Music can keep playing without adding more tracks manually.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_miniplayer_title">Controls stay with you</string>
    <string name="onboarding_miniplayer_description">The MiniPlayer is available on every tab. It shows the current track and playback progress, and lets you quickly add the track to favorites or skip it.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_system_media_title">Control playback from the system</string>
    <string name="onboarding_system_media_description">During playback, Android shows a system media card. Check the current track and use the main actions without opening the app.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_guest_description">Your phone is a remote for Qumi on the demo Discord server. See the current track and progress and use the same basic controls without typing commands.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_selection_title">Where do you want to control the bot?</string>
    <string name="onboarding_selection_guest_description">The demo server is selected. Your channel choice is where the bot joins; controls use its current channel when already connected.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_selection_description">Choose a server and a channel to join. When the bot is already in voice, controls use its current channel. You need access to that channel, but do not need to join it.</string>
